## Description

* Added counting badge (`+number`) over the thumbnail images(max 4).
* Updated server side codes
   1. When a user create new message in a channel, it also updates `updatedAt` field of the `Membership`
   ```
   \\\ added to resolvers/Message/mutation.ts
   export const createMessage = mutationField('createMessage',
    ........

        await prisma.membership.update({
      data: {
        updatedAt: created.createdAt,
      },
      where: {
        userId_channelId: {
          userId,
          channelId,
        },
      },
    });
  ```

   2. `Membership` model returns users sorted by `updatedAt` to show the name and thumbnail of the latest active(sent the message) user first.

    ```
    \\\ models/channel.ts

      resolve: ({id}, {excludeMe}, {prisma, userId}) => {
        if (excludeMe)
          return prisma.membership.findMany({
            where: {
              channel: {id},
              user: {
                id: {not: userId ?? undefined},
              },
            },
            include: {user: true},
            orderBy: [
              {
                updatedAt: 'desc',
              },
            ],
          });

        return prisma.membership.findMany({
          where: {channel: {id}},
          include: {user: true},
          orderBy: [
            {
              updatedAt: 'desc',
            },
          ],
        });
      }

    ```

   3. Updated subscription 'onMessage' accordingly for real-time UI update
   

   ```
    \\\\ components/navigations/MainStackNavigator/index.tsx

  subscription MainStackNavigatorOnMessageSubscription($deviceKey: String!) {
    onMessage(deviceKey: $deviceKey) {
      id
      imageUrls
      channel {
        id
        lastMessage {
          id
          messageType
          text
          imageUrls
          fileUrls
          createdAt
        }

       // added lines
        memberships(excludeMe: true) {
          user {
            name
            nickname
            thumbURL
            photoURL
          }
        }

      }
      sender {
        id
        name
        nickname
      }
      createdAt
      ...MessageListItem_message
    }
  }

   ```

